      "content": "what if it isn't just a storm? what if this is just what's left? i'm 42. i've lost my reputation, my livelihood, and my friends. i'm just sitting here in the dark wondering why i even bothered to fight for a world that clearly prefers the lie. it feels like i'm just a ghost occupying space that doesn't want me anymore. is there even a point to trying to rebuild when the foundation is just gone?",
